## Original Content
Avantika and Jack Martin are thanking viewers after the news that their 'Friends'-esque series — Kaling's first sole creator credit since 'The Mindy Project' — has not been renewed for a second season at Hulu.

## Summary
Hulu cancels Mindy Kaling's series 'Not Suitable for Work' after one season; creators Avantika and Jack Martin thank viewers. Kaling expresses affection for making the show. The cancellation ends Kaling's first sole creator project since 'The Mindy Project'.

